//! Native bytes identical in every stock node of their class.
//!
//! A fixed value is evidence that the byte is not a per-perk setting, not a claim about
//! its role. The workbench locks these fields at their stock value and says so, which
//! leaves the fields that vary as the ones a reader has to think about.
//!
//! Generated by `schema::field_map::write_fixed_values` over the captured stock survey
//! (1613 stock actions). A site needs at least 10 stock rows. Regenerate it when the
//! survey or the field contracts change.

